  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your job is to sort waste on the conveyor belt before time runs out. Identify
    each item and decide whether it can be recycled or must be disposed of. Recycle
    as many items as possible to earn points and achieve the highest score!


    HOW
    IT WORKS

    1. Grab items from the moving conveyor belt.

    2. Identify the
    type of waste.

    3. Sort recyclable items into the correct bins.

    4. Leave
    other waste on the belt to be incinerated.


    WATCH OUT!

    - Correctly
    sorted items earn you points.

    - Incorrectly sorted items cost you points.

    -
    Items that cannot be recycled should be left on the conveyor belt.

    - Time
    is limited, so work quickly and carefully!


    READY TO START?


    Use the
    next pages to learn which items belong in each recycling bin.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
