  m_text: 'WELCOME TO RECYCLE RUSH!


    Welcome to the recycling facility! Your
    job is to sort waste into the correct recycling bins.

    Before you begin,
    take a moment to read the tutorial on the wall to learn which items belong in
    each category.


    When you''re ready, press OKAY then START to begin your
    shift. Sort as much waste as you can before time runs out!'
