  m_text: "You're now ready to work at the recycling facility. Keep an eye on the
    conveyor belt and sort each item carefully to achieve the highest score possible.\n\nREMEMBER:\n-
    SORT CORRECTLY \u2014 Place recyclable items into their matching bins to earn
    points.\n- THINK CAREFULLY \u2014 Incorrectly sorted items will cost you points.\n-
    KNOW WHAT TO LEAVE \u2014 Items that cannot be recycled should stay on the conveyor
    belt to be incinerated.\n- BE QUICK \u2014 You only have a limited amount of
    time to process the waste!\n\nGood luck!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
